WEBVTT

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:02.560
Chara-su!

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:04.730
Is everyone shugo-peppy again today?

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:06.140
As for us...

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.150
We're shugo-shugo-peppy!

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:10.690
Now it's time to start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:12.540
So take this shugo-fun anime...

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.910
To blow all those X feelings away!

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.660
Here goes! Everyone's hearts:

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.120
Unlock!

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:21.700
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:25.210
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.010
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:30.880
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:32.730
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:34.610
you're like a dream.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:36.460
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:38.350
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:40.190
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:41.990
it's like I'm dreaming.

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:45.790
Whenever I start something new

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:49.500
I get really excited,

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:53.170
though I pretend like it's nothing at all.

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:56.310
I've always been stubborn like that.

00:00:56.310 --> 00:01:03.950
I think it'd be nice if I could just be honest with myself.

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:07.740
But it's hard, you know?

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:11.870
I'll try working on it bit by bit.

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:16.490
It's party time!

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:20.240
Someday I'll transform into someone brand new.

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:23.980
But for now, I want to forget everything else

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:28.180
and discover all of the potential in me.

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:31.390
It's party time!

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:35.100
That brand new me is out there somewhere.

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:38.610
But for now, I just want to stay as I am

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:43.240
and find all of the things I can be.

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:45.030
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:54.790
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:58.380
"Miki's Laboratory - Part 1!"

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:06.600
I am the brilliant scientist who can create anything!

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:08.830
Professor Miki!

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:10.110
And I'm his assistant, Ran!

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:11.440
I'm also his assistant, Su!

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:15.400
Welcome to my laboratory!

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:18.530
Professor, what will you be inventing today?

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:21.370
I am glad that you asked.

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:23.830
The invention I will create today is:

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:28.210
Ta-da! Humanity's dream! A potion that'll turn you into an invisible man!

00:02:28.430 --> 00:02:31.480
Shouldn't it be an invisible Guardian Character potion instead?

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:35.910
"Invisible man" is fine. "Invisible Guardian Character" is way too long!

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:38.140
Then how about shortening it to "invisichara?"

00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:39.940
You sure love your abbreviations.

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:43.020
Look here! It doesn't matter what it's called!

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:45.060
It's an amazing invention, regardless!

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:48.120
Yes! Bravo, Professor Miki!

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:53.230
Invisible people can do all kinds of things.

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:55.200
Like playing all the pranks you want!

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:58.410
Ooh, I could play tricks on Ran's face!

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:00.190
That's the first thing you think of?

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:02.330
Let's test it out!

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:05.230
You want to scribble on Ran's face, right?

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:07.720
Um, yes... But how...

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:11.550
I need precious sacrifices in the name of science to complete my inventions!

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:12.630
Sacrifices?

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:14.830
So you're assuming it will fail?

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:17.640
I change my mind! I don't want to do this!

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:18.260
Okay, then Ran?

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:20.510
I've suddenly got a tummyache!

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:25.220
Oh? No one will help me with my scientific invention?

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:27.320
And you call yourselves my assistants?

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:31.000
Well, if it means that much, why don't you do it yourself, Professor Miki?

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.020
Uh, well that's...

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:35.450
It's all in the name of scientific progress, correct?

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:38.450
And shouldn't the scientist behind the experiment take responsibility for its results?

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:40.360
F-Fine.

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:45.540
Professor!

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:47.760
Did it fail?

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:50.120
Nah, it just went down the wrong pipe.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.250
You're starting to disappear!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.010
It's a complete success!

00:03:56.960 --> 00:04:00.600
Huh? Maybe I didn't make enough.

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:04.260
You look so weird, Miki!

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:05.710
Completely weird!

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:08.310
You two are the worst assistants ever!

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:09.720
Weirdo!

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.140
Total weirdo!

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:12.170
Hey, come back!

00:04:12.170 --> 00:04:14.060
Ran! Su!

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:17.020
N-No!

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:17.900
See you again!

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:21.130
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia!

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:26.030
The first Character we'll introduce is... Daichi!

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:30.240
Daichi's great at everything athletic!

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:36.070
He's Kukai's Guardian Character, who was a Guardian before he went to middle school.

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:43.510
He was born from Kukai's desire to test his limits. He's cheerful and never loses heart!

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:46.820
He's really bad at staying still, though.

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:58.360
Continuing on, the second Character is... Musashi!

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:03.530
Musashi is a bespectacled samurai Character.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:08.660
He's really smart and always thinks about complex stuff.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:12.410
He's Kairi's Guardian Character, who was a Guardian before he transferred schools.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:16.520
He was born from Kairi's desire to be just like Miyamoto Musashi.

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:24.010
We'll keep doing these Shugo Chara Encyclopedia introductions each week!

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:25.590
Look forward to it!

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:31.680
Shugo, shugo! Egg Battle!

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:35.110
Today we'll be playing the "touch and answer" character quiz again!

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:38.650
There are a bunch of Shugo Chara figures inside this box.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:42.730
Try to pick out the correct Character to solve the quiz, 'kay?

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:45.100
You Eggs feeling lucky?

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:46.260
Yeah!

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:47.560
Okay, here's the question:

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:51.330
Who is Nagihiko's Guardian Character?

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:53.270
Got it!

00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:55.960
Nice! Seems everyone knows the answer!

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:59.950
But can you pick the right one just by touching it?

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:00.730
No.

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:02.270
Wait, which one is...

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:03.170
Ah, maybe this one?

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:04.710
He wears a hat.

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:09.430
Spade's got a grip on it!

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:11.520
You other two, go for it!

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:14.350
Focus on your fingers!

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:18.710
Clover's totally into it!

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:19.930
Time's nearly up!

00:06:19.930 --> 00:06:21.950
Hurry, hurry!

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:23.480
This is totally it.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:24.560
Totally.

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:25.900
Totally.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:28.050
That's it!

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:30.970
All right, girls, answer together!

00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:32.650
Ready, set...

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:35.970
You all got it!

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:38.620
Nagihiko's Guardian Character is Rhythm!

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:40.960
You're all correct!

00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:45.500
You're all winners today!

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.610
Do your best next time!

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:56.090
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:06:56.090 --> 00:06:59.310
"Miki's Laboratory - Part 2!"

00:07:05.410 --> 00:07:08.030
I am the brilliant scientist who can create anything!

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:10.180
Professor Miki!

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:11.650
And I'm his assistant, Ran!

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:12.740
I'm also his assistant, Su!

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:16.710
Welcome to my laboratory!

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:19.620
Professor, what will you be inventing today?

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:23.200
I am glad that you asked.

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:25.480
The invention I will create today is...

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:32.500
Ta-da! Humanity's dream! A slightly-updated version of a potion that'll turn you into an invisible man!

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:34.880
But you completely messed that up before.

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:38.070
And it was quite difficult to get yourself back to normal.

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:41.250
Mistakes are an essential part of scientific discovery!

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:43.800
Anyway, I made extra this time.

00:07:43.800 --> 00:07:45.100
There will be no mistakes.

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:55.630
Just wait. Last time it stopped halfway.

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:56.620
Yeah.

00:07:58.280 --> 00:07:59.240
It worked!

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:00.540
Well done!

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:02.950
Professor Miki, it's a complete success!

00:08:02.950 --> 00:08:05.470
Whoa, what's happened?

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:08.770
That is indeed an excellent question!

00:08:08.770 --> 00:08:11.580
I can hear your voice, but I can't see you!

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:16.150
I can hear your voice, but I cannot see you!

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:20.180
Now we'll know where you are, Professor Miki.

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:22.370
But you look kind of funny.

00:08:22.370 --> 00:08:25.060
Um, guys, this potion-

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:25.560
Hey!

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.530
Why don't we drink it, too?

00:08:27.530 --> 00:08:28.850
Good idea!

00:08:28.850 --> 00:08:31.710
I've always wanted to steal Pepe's pacifier!

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:33.280
Wait, listen to-

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:41.170
We're disappearing!

00:08:41.170 --> 00:08:43.240
Yes, we are!

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:48.360
I'll explain.

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:52.820
Professor Miki's potion made them invisible, it's true.

00:08:52.820 --> 00:08:57.150
However, it also made their surroundings invisible to them.

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:02.430
Wow...

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:04.390
Quite a nasty side-effect, huh?

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:08.510
You look weird, Miki!

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:10.010
Totally weird!

00:09:10.010 --> 00:09:11.150
Weirdo Miki!

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:12.240
Weirdo!

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:15.480
Ran, Su! Stop!

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:18.320
Not again!

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:19.200
See you again!

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:24.080
Coming up next is Shugo Chara!!! Dokki Doki!

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:27.100
Today's episode is titled "The Place Eggs Return To."

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:29.960
It stars Rikka, who understands X Eggs!

00:09:31.740 --> 00:09:34.430
Don't act like an X Egg!

00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:37.630
And don't act like Kusukusu either!

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:39.670
Sheesh!

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:54.850
What's really important?

00:09:56.110 --> 00:10:00.900
Well, it's white and round and sunny,

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:08.160
and even if they don't know it, everyone has one in their heart.

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:19.500
The faith I have in others is what keeps me going.

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:24.220
Guardian Eggs and X Eggs, Guardian Characters and X Characters...

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:28.590
They're all precious things.

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:32.760
And so, Open Heart, go!

00:10:32.760 --> 00:10:34.290
Everything'll be okay.

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:37.350
Because even if you feel lost,

00:10:37.350 --> 00:10:40.780
you're not alone.

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:42.940
We'll always be together.

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:45.580
And when I think of that, somehow,

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:48.610
I feel warm and fuzzy inside.

00:10:48.610 --> 00:10:51.790
Open Heart, now!

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:53.450
You can see the eggs, right?

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:58.460
They're smiling and bouncing around.

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:04.300
So from now on, forever and ever...

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:06.520
I'll be counting on you!

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:28.240
Rikka, aren't you supposed to be helping?

00:11:28.240 --> 00:11:30.320
Oh yeah, oops!

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:33.610
Rikka-chan got distracted again.

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:34.510
Again.

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:35.880
Yes, again.

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:42.010
We need to get Yaya and Hikaru-kun soon.

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:43.180
Let me!

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:46.060
I'll go!

00:11:46.980 --> 00:11:49.500
They're in the flower garden, right?

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:51.300
Yeah, but...

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:54.140
You'll probably get distracted on the way.

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:55.840
You'd never stay on track.

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:58.160
It'd be a bit foolish to send you.

00:11:58.160 --> 00:12:00.720
Let me go!

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.710
Can't she?

00:12:02.710 --> 00:12:04.340
Why don't we send her?

00:12:05.610 --> 00:12:08.050
Are you sure that's a good idea?

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:11.050
No, she's bound to get into trouble...

00:12:11.050 --> 00:12:12.560
That's it!

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:15.500
Why don't you guys go with her?

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:18.480
I suppose we should!

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:28.470
The Place Eggs Return To

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:31.020
Don't get lost, people.

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:34.450
Uh, that's more of a concern for you, Rikka-chan.

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:38.400
We can totally handle this.

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:41.730
Even though you're teensy-weensy?

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:43.530
Of course!

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:50.960
What's the matter?

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:51.990
This way!

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:55.070
Man, knew it...

00:12:55.070 --> 00:12:57.330
Wait up, Rikka-chan!

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:05.060
Rikka-chan!

00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:06.210
What'll we do?

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:08.340
We were supposed to stay with her!

00:13:08.340 --> 00:13:09.700
Ah, there she is!

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:14.920
Rikka-chan, quit that!

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:16.100
Oh, sorry.

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:17.940
What are you doing?

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:19.120
What about Yaya-chan and Hikaru?

00:13:19.120 --> 00:13:20.610
Wait.

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:27.220
A bird's egg?

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:35.270
Aw, it fell?

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:36.580
Okay!

00:13:40.870 --> 00:13:41.960
Rikka-chan!

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:43.550
That's dangerous!

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:45.510
You shouldn't do this.

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:47.480
I've gotta try!

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:56.090
Rikka-chan!

00:13:56.090 --> 00:13:57.110
You okay?

00:13:57.110 --> 00:13:59.230
Yeah... But what should I do?

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:03.690
Just leave this to us!

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:24.540
You guys were great!

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:26.800
It's only because you noticed the egg first.

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:31.260
The bird's voice sounded troubled to me, is all.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:35.460
I'm glad we could help get the egg back to its home.

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:36.360
Yeah!

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:44.700
When lost X Eggs are cleansed by Open Heart, they return to their owners, right?

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:45.600
Yeah.

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:50.140
But what happens if that person already has a new egg?

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:51.720
Um...

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:56.700
Maybe they'd turn back into a heart's egg, but stay lost?

00:14:57.430 --> 00:14:58.770
Stay lost?

00:15:00.990 --> 00:15:02.950
Poor things...

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:08.050
An X Egg?

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:12.510
An X Egg!

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:17.010
Are you okay?

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:19.400
Hey, you!

00:15:23.960 --> 00:15:24.880
Wait!

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:26.390
Don't go, Rikka-chan!

00:15:26.390 --> 00:15:28.740
It's dangerous to chase after them by yourself!

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:32.750
You've gotta alert Amu-chan and the others first!

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:35.140
Right.

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:40.000
That's right...

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:47.140
Sheesh, where the heck did she run off to?

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:49.750
Amu-chan! Rikka-chan's in trouble!

00:15:49.750 --> 00:15:53.850
She went after an X Egg she found, by herself!

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:55.870
It was near the sports fields!

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:57.530
Let's go!

00:15:57.530 --> 00:15:58.370
Right.

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:00.140
Wait!

00:16:02.280 --> 00:16:03.980
Are you okay?

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:08.360
I'm sorry for scaring you before.

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:12.030
Don't lose control!

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:27.450
It's okay, you don't have to be afraid.

00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:32.090
Here, come to Rikka!

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:45.920
Why did you get an X on you?

00:16:47.660 --> 00:16:49.900
Oh, a designer?

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:55.120
But you're clumsy and that's why you felt hopeless?

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:57.320
You're really a klutz, you know?

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:00.070
Sorry!

00:17:00.070 --> 00:17:01.370
Rikka!

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:05.720
S-Senpai!

00:17:05.720 --> 00:17:08.710
I'm sorry, I shouldn't have gone off by myself.

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:11.900
Are you okay? Where's the X Egg?

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:16.050
Um, she wanted to become a designer.

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:19.440
A well-behaved X Egg?

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:21.760
She doesn't look hurt.

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:22.770
Thank goodness.

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:25.200
Amu-chan, Open Heart!

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:26.020
Coming right up!

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:30.650
My heart: Unlock!

00:17:47.050 --> 00:17:49.790
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:55.630
Negative heart: Lock on!

00:17:57.790 --> 00:18:00.140
Open Heart!

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:17.390
Rikka...

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:19.810
It may have all worked out okay this time,

00:18:19.810 --> 00:18:23.160
but it's still dangerous for you to go after X Eggs by yourself.

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:25.540
Huh?

00:18:26.090 --> 00:18:28.640
Hey! Where are you going?

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:30.460
She might get lost!

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:32.950
Could she be...

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:35.060
Oh!

00:18:36.270 --> 00:18:37.710
Not you guys, too!

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:38.660
Hey!

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:40.050
What is it now?

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:41.580
Lost?

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:44.370
Listen up, Rima!

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:46.060
I bet Rikka is...

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:54.650
Are you okay, Rikka-chan?

00:18:54.990 --> 00:18:55.980
Yeah!

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:00.420
This way, Rikka-chan!

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:02.820
The owner is nearby.

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:55.550
She went back to her owner!

00:19:55.550 --> 00:19:58.500
That girl got her dream back!

00:19:59.540 --> 00:20:01.700
Thanks for guiding me.

00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:06.360
You Guardian Characters might be small, but you're reliable.

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:17.800
The same heart's egg gives birth to both Guardian Characters and X Eggs.

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:19.790
How mysterious.

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:24.910
I'm sure you'll give birth to an egg just as radiant, Rikka-chan.

00:20:25.610 --> 00:20:27.070
You think so?

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:35.540
She said that I'd give birth to a radiant egg, too!

00:20:36.350 --> 00:20:39.860
It might even hatch into a Guardian Character!

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:47.340
You guys might even be able to become Guardian Characters.

00:20:55.890 --> 00:21:01.390
I wonder what kind of Guardian Character I'd have.

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:12.620
It's time for Guardian Egg Fortune-Telling!

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:16.510
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:21.310
Which egg is the lucky one?

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:27.180
Guardian Egg Studying Fortune!

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:29.720
First, for those who chose Miki:

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:30.730
Four Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:30.730 --> 00:21:32.370
Super Lucky!

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:37.370
You'll make good progress in your studies and will solve even the most difficult problems!

00:21:38.090 --> 00:21:40.170
Ran's egg gets three Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:40.170 --> 00:21:42.990
Studying will be easier if you work at it step by step.

00:21:40.170 --> 00:21:42.990
Do your homework nicely and neatly, and it'll go fast!

00:21:42.990 --> 00:21:44.960
Dia's egg gets two Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:44.960 --> 00:21:47.140
You might find a way that suits you better!

00:21:44.960 --> 00:21:47.440
Try changing your study methods.

00:21:48.310 --> 00:21:50.970
Finally, for those who chose Su's egg:

00:21:50.970 --> 00:21:53.930
Um, you get, um... one Shugoluck Star.

00:21:53.930 --> 00:21:57.550
There might be a pop-quiz! If you're not prepared, your grade will be...

00:21:57.550 --> 00:22:00.380
It's important to review every day!

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:03.010
Your lucky item is a handkerchief!

00:22:04.230 --> 00:22:08.960
Shugo Chara Egg! Amulet Diamond Audition Report!

00:22:11.690 --> 00:22:17.640
Thanks for each and every application we received from around the country!

00:22:18.240 --> 00:22:23.050
Next time, we'll finally announce the people who passed the first round!

00:22:23.050 --> 00:22:26.380
I just can't wait to get ourselves a new Diamond!

00:22:26.380 --> 00:22:28.830
Stay tuned, folks!

00:22:32.860 --> 00:22:34.850
She said it's finally time for the auditions!

00:22:34.850 --> 00:22:36.540
I'm so excited!

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:40.020
Make sure you check out the next audition report!

00:22:40.020 --> 00:22:42.560
See you next week for another episode of Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:42.560 --> 00:22:45.790
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:46.490 --> 00:22:48.020
Bye-bye!

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:58.050
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:18.710
Let's put our hands together for you! Yes, you!

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:22.590
Let's put our hands together! That's what I wanna do!

00:23:25.140 --> 00:23:30.290
Now put your hands together for me! Yes, me!

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:34.100
Now put your hands together! It's what you should do!

00:23:34.700 --> 00:23:40.080
When I first heard your big dream,

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:45.480
it was like I was whisked away to another place!

00:23:46.340 --> 00:23:52.690
So, I only know a tiny sliver of the world,

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:56.780
but at least you're here to talk to me.

00:23:56.780 --> 00:24:02.840
Hey! When I saw that look, that serious attitude...

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:09.100
Before I knew it, my heart was all aflutter!

00:24:09.100 --> 00:24:10.190
Bravo!

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:14.650
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!
